le":"Styles","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/homekit#Styles","line":194},{"title":"Black HomeKit icon","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/homekit#Black-HomeKit-icon","line":198},{"title":"A black outlined HomeKit icon.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/739a8ed96d427f7a1e8eb680feab203c/homekit-black-icon-set%402x.png","line":202,"embedded":true},{"title":"White HomeKit icon","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/homekit#White-HomeKit-icon","line":204},{"title":"A white outlined HomeKit icon.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/86f0a2b6f128e579b0b2400f3e8c7fa7/homekit-white-icon-set%402x.png","line":208,"embedded":true},{"title":"Custom color HomeKit icon","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/homekit#Custom-color-HomeKit-icon","line":210},{"title":"A blue outlined HomeKit icon.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/f7e6e6aaf077dbcb7cba53cbadf8436d/homekit-custom-color-icon-set%402x.png","line":214,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of three app icons listed in a horizontal row. Text above the icons reads 'Integrate with'. The leftmost app icon is the HomeKit icon in a circle, above the text 'Apple HomeKit'. The remaining two app icons contain squares with dashed frames witihn circles, above text that reads 'Technology'.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/d4b79f9c55760002e886eb66776c4044/homekit-settings%402x.png","line":218,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of an incorrectly used HomeKit icon in a circular button styled with a chrome appearance.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/08c6b1888cd04ea864bfe8d037eb1814/homekit-donot1%402x.png","line":222,"embedded":true},{"title":"An X in a circle to indicate incorrect usage.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/209f6f0fc8ad99d9bf59e12d82d06584/crossout%402x.png","line":224,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of a button incorrectly titled 'HomeKit' with a custom gradient background.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/0c8ae4ebd1f0d755d78391a46602eda0/homekit-donot2%402x.png","line":226,"embedded":true},{"title":"An X in a circle to indicate incorrect usage.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/209f6f0fc8ad99d9bf59e12d82d06584/crossout%402x.png","line":228,"embedded":true},{"title":"Referring to HomeKit","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/homekit#Referring-to-HomeKit","line":230},{"title":"The first in a series of images showing examples of the HomeKit icon when used in text. In this example, the icon correctly appears first in the line, and then the text 'Lights set with HomeKit.'","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/36d82399473bdcb7c28130fd4451d8a2/homekit-lights-right%402x.png","line":232,"embedded":true},{"title":"A checkmark in a circle to indicate correct usage.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/88662da92338267bb64cd2275c84e484/checkmark%402x.png","line":234,"embedded":true},{"title":"The second in a series of images showing examples of the HomeKit icon when used in text. This example depicts the icon incorrectly positioned after the word 'with' in the text 'Lights set with HomeKit.'","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/c807ea2f349cf7b4765dbf556583c701/homekit-lights-wrong1%402x.png","line":236,"embedded":true},{"title":"An X in a circle to indicate incorrect usage.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/209f6f0fc8ad99d9bf59e12d82d06584/crossout%402x.png","line":238,"embedded":true},{"title":"The third in a series of images showing examples of the HomeKit icon when used in text. This example depicts the icon incorrectly positioned at the end of the line of text that reads 'Lights set with'.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/5b77fd061bc43cba46493fd96a9bae74/homekit-lights-wrong2%402x.png","line":240,"embedded":true},{"title":"An X in a circle to indicate incorrect usage.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/209f6f0fc8ad99d9bf59e12d82d06584/crossout%402x.png","line":242,"embedded":true},{"title":"Referring to HomeKit","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/homekit#Referring-to-HomeKit","line":244},{"title":"An illustration of a view containing setup information within an app. The top of the view includes the title 'Setup' above a divider line. Three rows with icons, text, and disclosure buttons for displaying additional information appear below the divider. The first row includes the HomeKit icon followed by the word 'HomeKit'. The other  two rows display dashed squares representing other app icons, each followed by the word 'Name'.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/e3e956f06b1658b6e2a1776c9015ad66/homekit-setup%402x.png","line":246,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of a view containing a grid of four app buttons. The top of the view includes the title 'Apps' above a divider line. Two rows of buttons and labels appear below the divider. The first button in the first row includes the Apple Home app icon, and appears above the text 'Apple Home'. The remaining buttons include dashed squares representing other app icons, and each appears above the text 'App Name'.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/2ff6f6ad2861c485ab76b4f2561de95e/homekit-apps%402x.png","line":248,"embedded":true},{"title":"Referring to HomeKit","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/homekit#Referring-to-HomeKit","line":250},{"title":"Apple Trademark List","target":"https://www.apple.com/legal/intellectual-property/trademark/appletmlist.html","line":254},{"title":"A checkmark in a circle to indicate correct us